      "name_en": "GLOOM SOURCE",
      "description_en": "This planet continually produces a thick atmospheric Gloom cover, rendering logistical support extremely challenging.\nTotal Reinforcements are reduced by <i=1>20%,</i> Eagle Re-arm time is increased by <i=1>30%</i> and Ammo from pickups is reduced by <i=1>50%.</i>",
      "name_zh": "“阴霾”源头",
      "description_zh": "这颗星球持续积累厚重的“阴霾”孢子层，使后勤支援变得极其困难。\n总增援数减少<i=1>20%</i>，“飞鹰”重新装弹时间延长<i=1>30%</i>，拾取获得的弹药数量减少<i=1>50%</i>。",
      "name_zht": "憂霾源頭",
      "description_zht": "此星球持續產生濃厚的憂霾，覆蓋了大氣層，導致後勤支援極度困難。\n總增援數量降低<i=1>20%</i>，飛鷹武器重新裝備時間增加<i=1>30%</i>，彈藥拾取量降低<i=1>50%。</i>"
    },
